OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening for all, though staying rather
OL,7,Fbreezy. Cloud increasing overnight
OL,8,Fwith a few showers possible during the
OL,9,Fearly hours, perhaps thundery for
OL,10,Fsome. Turning increasingly humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA humid day, with a mixture
OL,13,Fof sunny spells and a scattering of
OL,14,Fshowers. Some of these could be heavy
OL,15,Fand thundery in places. Feeling warm
OL,16,Fin the sunnier moments.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
